          "widget": {
            "name": "footnote",
            "multilineTextboxSpec": {
              "lines": [
                "**How it's counted.** League matches of the regular season, and cup matches except finals, which are played at a neutral venue. A match decided on penalties counts as the draw it was. 3 points for a win, 1 for a draw.\n",
                "\n",
                "**How precise it is.** After 100 matches, a league's share of points is known to about ±8 percentage points; after a full 380-match season, to about ±4 (95%). A season in progress can sit well away from the long-run value. A team's gap between home and away carries about ±0.45 points per game over 17 games each.\n",
                "\n",
                "Football data provided by the Football-Data.org API."
              ]
            }
          },
